    Speed: 48 km/h   Heading: NE

▣  Battery
    78%   Charging: No

⌁  Network
    Online (4G)

▣  Vehicle Telemetry
    Speed: 48 km/h   RPM: 1820
    Engine Load: 32%  Temp: 87°C

◷  Timestamp
    2026-09-20 09:41:23"
            android:textColor="@color/ok_text" android:textSize="14sp"/>
    </LinearLayout>
</ScrollView>
